WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.188
This query combines two cleaning steps BTRIM removes
boundary spaces

00:00:07.939 --> 00:00:14.639
REGEXP_REPLACE then collapses repeated internal
whitespace to one space The

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:20.399
g flag means replace every matching occurrence not
just the first Run

00:00:20.426 --> 00:00:23.689
the query and compare the raw and normalized names
row by row
